---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Privacy Policy | BuyLandCR"
    description="Privacy Policy for BuyLandCR. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information in compliance with international advertising standards."
>
    <section class="py-16 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h1
            class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-8"
        >
            Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mb-8">
            Last Updated: {
                new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-US", {
                    year: "numeric",
                    month: "long",
                    day: "numeric",
                })
            }
        </p>

        <div
            class="prose prose-neutral max-w-none text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed"
        >
            <p>
                At BuyLandCR ("we," "our," or "us"), we are committed to
                protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we
                collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you
                visit our website <strong>buylandcr.com</strong>. We respect
                your privacy and are committed to protecting the personal data
                we hold about you.
            </p>

            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-neutral-900">
                1. Information We Collect
            </h3>
            <p class="mb-4">
                We may collect information about you in a variety of ways. The
                information we may collect on the Site includes:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-6">
                <li>
                    <strong>Personal Data:</strong> Personally identifiable information,
                    such as your name, email address, and telephone number, that you
                    voluntarily provide to us via our contact forms or when inquiring
                    about specific property listings.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Derivative Data:</strong> Information our servers automatically
                    collect when you access the Site, such as your IP address, browser
                    type, operating system, access times, and the pages you viewed
                    directly before and after accessing the Site.
                </li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-neutral-900">
                2. Use of Your Information
            </h3>
            <p class="mb-4">
                Accurate information permits us to provide you with a high-end,
                efficient, and customized experience. We use the information to:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-6">
                <li>
                    Respond to inquiries and provide curated property
                    recommendations.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Compile anonymous statistical data for internal market
                    analysis.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Deliver targeted advertising and newsletters regarding new
                    investment opportunities in La Fortuna.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Improve the overall functionality and security of our
                    digital platform.
                </li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-neutral-900">
                3. Google Analytics & Advertising (Cookies)
            </h3>
            <p class="mb-4">
                We use third-party vendors, including <strong
                    >Google Analytics</strong
                > and
                <strong>Google Ads</strong>, to analyze and track users'
                activity on our Site. These vendors use first-party and
                third-party cookies to:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-6">
                <li>Remarket listings you have previously viewed.</li>
                <li>
                    Optimize ad delivery based on your past visits to our
                    website.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Report how our ad impressions and other ad service features
                    are related to visits to our site.
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="bg-neutral-50 p-4 border-l-4 border-neutral-300 italic">
                <strong>Opt-Out:</strong> You can opt-out of Google's use of cookies
                by visiting the
                <a
                    href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads"
                    target="_blank"
                    class="text-green-700 underline">Google Ads Settings</a
                >
                or by installing the <a
                    href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout/"
                    target="_blank"
                    class="text-green-700 underline"
                    >Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a
                >.
            </p>

            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-neutral-900">
                4. Disclosure of Your Information
            </h3>
            <p class="mb-4">
                We do not sell your personal data. We may share information we
                have collected about you in specific situations, such as with
                trusted legal partners during a due diligence process (only with
                your explicit consent) or to comply with legal obligations and
                protect our rights.
            </p>

            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-neutral-900">
                5. Security of Your Information
            </h3>
            <p class="mb-4">
                We use administrative, technical, and physical security measures
                to protect your personal information. However, please be aware
                that no security measures are perfect. We encourage you to use
                secure connections when submitting information.
            </p>

            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-neutral-900">
                6. Contact Us
            </h3>
            <p class="mb-4">
                For questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact our
                team:
            </p>
            <div class="bg-neutral-900 text-white p-6 rounded-lg mt-4">
                <p class="font-bold text-xl mb-1">BuyLandCR</p>
                <p class="text-neutral-400">
                    Premium Real Estate & Land Investment
                </p>
                <p class="mt-4 italic">La Fortuna, San Carlos, Costa Rica</p>
                <p class="mt-2">
                    Email: <a
                        href="mailto:terrenoslafortunacr@gmail.com"
                        class="text-green-400 hover:text-green-300 transition-colors"
                        >terrenoslafortunacr@gmail.com</a
                    >
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
